# Implementation Plan: Store Head Role Setup & RBAC

Implement the operational role, workflows, store-level inventory management, and dynamic navigation for the **Store Head (Central Store / College or Department Store / Cafeteria Store / ICT Store)**.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Store Head Operational Authority**:
> Store Head is operationally responsible for their specific campus store. Key responsibilities include:
> 1. Recording goods receipt for delivered materials.
> 2. Maintaining item locations (bins/shelves) and inter-bin transfers within their store.
> 3. Creating preliminary Store/Inter-Store Issue Vouchers (Model 20) against approved requisitions.
> 4. Finalizing and issuing official vouchers (Model 22), triggering automatic FIFO stock deduction.
> 5. Initiating inter-store Material Transfer Requests to or from their store.
> 6. Flagging damaged/expired items and compiling disposal requests.
> 7. Viewing Store Stock Cards and Bin Cards for all items in their store.
> 8. Participating in and recording physical stock takes.

